          "snippet": {
            "line": 230,
            "text": "theorem exists_solution {D : Design} {θ : Params} (hD : D.Admissible) (hθ : D.InBox θ)\n    {Cf : ℝ → ℝ} (hCf : ∀ x, D.Clo ≤ Cf x) {Kc : ℝ}\n    (hCfLip : ∀ x ∈ D.Safe, ∀ y ∈ D.Safe, |Cf x - Cf y| ≤ Kc * |x - y|)\n    {u w : ℝ → ℝ} (hu : Continuous u) (hw : Continuous w)\n    {a b : ℝ} (hab : a ≤ b) (hwb : ∀ t ∈ Icc a b, |w t| ≤ D.eps) {v₀ : ℝ}\n    (hv₀ : v₀ ∈ D.Safe) :\n    ∃ v : ℝ → ℝ, v a = v₀ ∧ (∀ t ∈ Icc a b, v t ∈ D.Safe) ∧\n      ∀ t ∈ Icc a b,\n        HasDerivWithinAt v ((Inet θ (u t) (v t) + w t) / Cf (v t)) (Icc a b) t := by"
          },
          "declaration": {
            "id": "VoltageToBit.exists_solution",
            "kind": "theorem"
          }
        }
      }
